!
! One account's statement for a period, in Trebago (reckoner_rules.h RR1),
! one account per row: closing = opening + credits - debits, in integer
! minor units, exact. credits and debits are totals of one direction each:
! a total below 0 makes ok 0 and the answer a division by zero, refused.
! A result past 64 bits is refused by Trebago itself, never wrapped.
! statement.sutra holds 18 digits: past them the two disagree and the
! answer is held.
trebago statement
  in  opening(n), credits(n), debits(n)
  out closing(n)
  var ok(n)
  ok(i) = min(1, max(0, credits(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, debits(i) + 1))
  closing(i) = (opening(i) + credits(i) - debits(i)) / ok(i)
end
